  "power_radar.ponder.radar_basics.header": "Build a Radar",
  "power_radar.ponder.radar_basics.text_1": "The Radar Controller is the main block of the structure.",
  "power_radar.ponder.radar_basics.text_2":"Panels allow the controller to see targets.",
  "power_radar.ponder.link_basics.header": "Linking radars",
  "power_radar.ponder.link_basics.text_1": "When placed, radar link creates a new network.",
  "power_radar.ponder.link_basics.text_2": "Right-click on an existing link to link them.",
  "power_radar.ponder.link_basics.text_3": "If the connection is successful, the radar data will be visible on the display.",
  "power_radar.ponder.link_basics.text_4": "The compass can be linked to the network and will point to the selected target.",
  "power_radar.ponder.logic_dock_basics.header": "Logic dock connection",
  "power_radar.ponder.logic_dock_basics.text_1": "Logic Dock allows you to apply detection and targeting filters, as well as create whitelists of players and sable structures.",
  "power_radar.ponder.logic_dock_basics.text_2": "The targeting card allows you to select categories for auto-aiming cannons.",
  "power_radar.ponder.logic_dock_basics.text_3": "The display card allows you to select target categories to display on screens.",
  "power_radar.ponder.logic_dock_basics.text_4": "Allowlist card allows you to add players and sable structures to the white/black list.",
  "power_radar.ponder.targeting_basic.header": "Target controller",
  "power_radar.ponder.targeting_basic.text_1": "The Target controller allows cannons to be automatically aimed in manual and automatic modes.",
  "power_radar.ponder.targeting_basic.text_2": "Auto-aiming is enabled for targets selected on the display or for targets from selected categories in the targeting card.",
  "power_radar.ponder.shell_alarm.header": "Shell alarm",
  "power_radar.ponder.shell_alarm.text_1": "To connect the shell alarm to the network, right-click on the radar link.",
  "power_radar.ponder.shell_alarm.text_2": "The size of the protected zone is adjusted by holding right-click on the shell alarm.",
  "power_radar.ponder.shell_alarm.text_3": "In the presence of dangerous projectiles, the shell alarm emits a redstone signal with a strength of 15.",
  "power_radar.ponder.interception_controller.header": "Interception controller",
  "power_radar.ponder.interception_controller.text_1": "When deployed, Shell alarm creates an interception network.",
  "power_radar.ponder.interception_controller.text_2": "To connect the interception controller to the interception network, right-click on the shell alarm.",
  "power_radar.ponder.interception_controller.text_3": "To intercept projectiles, a flac round with an interception fuse is required.",
  "power_radar.ponder.onboard_computer.header": "Onboard computer",
  "power_radar.ponder.onboard_computer.text_1": "The onboard computer can only be installed on a sable structure. It creates its own radar network, to which everything except the target controller can be connected.",
